§§ `s 2(1) call, put`

-- columns:        transferable specified-number fixed-price specified-time demand deliver grantor's-own
`a call` MEANS `Terms of an option` WITH
    `transferable by delivery` IS TRUE
    `for a specified number or amount of securities` IS TRUE
    `at a fixed price` IS TRUE
    `within a specified time` IS TRUE
    `to demand delivery of the securities` IS TRUE
    `to deliver the securities` IS FALSE
    `an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted it` IS FALSE
`a put` MEANS `Terms of an option` WITH
    `transferable by delivery` IS TRUE
    `for a specified number or amount of securities` IS TRUE
    `at a fixed price` IS TRUE
    `within a specified time` IS TRUE
    `to demand delivery of the securities` IS FALSE
    `to deliver the securities` IS TRUE
    `an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted it` IS FALSE
`an option on the grantor's own securities` MEANS `Terms of an option` WITH
    `transferable by delivery` IS TRUE
    `for a specified number or amount of securities` IS TRUE
    `at a fixed price` IS TRUE
    `within a specified time` IS TRUE
    `to demand delivery of the securities` IS TRUE
    `to deliver the securities` IS FALSE
    `an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted it` IS TRUE
`a call that cannot be transferred by delivery` MEANS `Terms of an option` WITH
    `transferable by delivery` IS FALSE
    `for a specified number or amount of securities` IS TRUE
    `at a fixed price` IS TRUE
    `within a specified time` IS TRUE
    `to demand delivery of the securities` IS TRUE
    `to deliver the securities` IS FALSE
    `an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted it` IS FALSE
`a call with no fixed price` MEANS `Terms of an option` WITH
    `transferable by delivery` IS TRUE
    `for a specified number or amount of securities` IS TRUE
    `at a fixed price` IS FALSE
    `within a specified time` IS TRUE
    `to demand delivery of the securities` IS TRUE
    `to deliver the securities` IS FALSE
    `an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted it` IS FALSE
`a call with no specified time` MEANS `Terms of an option` WITH
    `transferable by delivery` IS TRUE
    `for a specified number or amount of securities` IS TRUE
    `at a fixed price` IS TRUE
    `within a specified time` IS FALSE
    `to demand delivery of the securities` IS TRUE
    `to deliver the securities` IS FALSE
    `an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted it` IS FALSE
`a call with no specified amount` MEANS `Terms of an option` WITH
    `transferable by delivery` IS TRUE
    `for a specified number or amount of securities` IS FALSE
    `at a fixed price` IS TRUE
    `within a specified time` IS TRUE
    `to demand delivery of the securities` IS TRUE
    `to deliver the securities` IS FALSE
    `an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted it` IS FALSE
`a put with no fixed price` MEANS `Terms of an option` WITH
    `transferable by delivery` IS TRUE
    `for a specified number or amount of securities` IS TRUE
    `at a fixed price` IS FALSE
    `within a specified time` IS TRUE
    `to demand delivery of the securities` IS FALSE
    `to deliver the securities` IS TRUE
    `an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted it` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `call within s 2(1)` `a call`
#ASSERT (NOT `put within s 2(1)` `a call`)
#ASSERT `put within s 2(1)` `a put`
#ASSERT (NOT `call within s 2(1)` `a put`)
-- a call "does not include an option or right to acquire securities of the corporation that granted" it
#ASSERT (NOT `call within s 2(1)` `an option on the grantor's own securities`)
#ASSERT (NOT `call within s 2(1)` `a call that cannot be transferred by delivery`)
#ASSERT (NOT `call within s 2(1)` `a call with no fixed price`)
#ASSERT (NOT `call within s 2(1)` `a call with no specified time`)
#ASSERT (NOT `call within s 2(1)` `a call with no specified amount`)
#ASSERT (NOT `put within s 2(1)` `a put with no fixed price`)

