§§ `s 2(1) distributing corporation, with s 2(6) and s 2(7)`

-- columns: on application, for a class, Director satisfied, Director determined "not a distributing corporation"
`no determination` MEANS `Determination about distributing status` WITH
    `made on the application of the corporation` IS FALSE
    `made for a class of corporations that includes the corporation` IS FALSE
    `the Director was satisfied that it would not be prejudicial to the public interest` IS FALSE
    `the Director determined that the corporation is not or was not a distributing corporation` IS FALSE
`a determination on application, Director satisfied` MEANS `Determination about distributing status` WITH
    `made on the application of the corporation` IS TRUE
    `made for a class of corporations that includes the corporation` IS FALSE
    `the Director was satisfied that it would not be prejudicial to the public interest` IS TRUE
    `the Director determined that the corporation is not or was not a distributing corporation` IS TRUE
`a determination for a class, Director satisfied` MEANS `Determination about distributing status` WITH
    `made on the application of the corporation` IS FALSE
    `made for a class of corporations that includes the corporation` IS TRUE
    `the Director was satisfied that it would not be prejudicial to the public interest` IS TRUE
    `the Director determined that the corporation is not or was not a distributing corporation` IS TRUE
`a determination on application, Director not satisfied` MEANS `Determination about distributing status` WITH
    `made on the application of the corporation` IS TRUE
    `made for a class of corporations that includes the corporation` IS FALSE
    `the Director was satisfied that it would not be prejudicial to the public interest` IS FALSE
    `the Director determined that the corporation is not or was not a distributing corporation` IS TRUE
`a determination on neither footing` MEANS `Determination about distributing status` WITH
    `made on the application of the corporation` IS FALSE
    `made for a class of corporations that includes the corporation` IS FALSE
    `the Director was satisfied that it would not be prejudicial to the public interest` IS TRUE
    `the Director determined that the corporation is not or was not a distributing corporation` IS TRUE
`an application the Director refused` MEANS `Determination about distributing status` WITH
    `made on the application of the corporation` IS TRUE
    `made for a class of corporations that includes the corporation` IS FALSE
    `the Director was satisfied that it would not be prejudicial to the public interest` IS TRUE
    `the Director determined that the corporation is not or was not a distributing corporation` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `distributing corporation within s 2(1)` TRUE `no determination`
#ASSERT (NOT `distributing corporation within s 2(1)` FALSE `no determination`)
#ASSERT (NOT `distributing corporation within s 2(1)` TRUE `a determination on application, Director satisfied`)
#ASSERT (NOT `distributing corporation within s 2(1)` TRUE `a determination for a class, Director satisfied`)
#ASSERT `distributing corporation within s 2(1)` TRUE `a determination on application, Director not satisfied`
#ASSERT `distributing corporation within s 2(1)` TRUE `a determination on neither footing`
#ASSERT `distributing corporation within s 2(1)` TRUE `an application the Director refused`
#ASSERT `the Director may determine on application within s 2(6)` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT (NOT `the Director may determine on application within s 2(6)` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT (NOT `the Director may determine on application within s 2(6)` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `the Director may determine for a class within s 2(7)` TRUE
#ASSERT (NOT `the Director may determine for a class within s 2(7)` FALSE)

