§§ `s 2(1) ordinary resolution, special resolution`

`51 for, 49 against` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 51
    `votes cast against` IS 49
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE
`50 for, 50 against` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 50
    `votes cast against` IS 50
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE
`2 for, 1 against` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 2
    `votes cast against` IS 1
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE
`1 for, 2 against` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 1
    `votes cast against` IS 2
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE
`no vote cast` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 0
    `votes cast against` IS 0
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE
`200 for, 100 against` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 200
    `votes cast against` IS 100
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE
`199 for, 101 against` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 199
    `votes cast against` IS 101
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE
`10 for, 20 against, signed by all entitled to vote` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 10
    `votes cast against` IS 20
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS TRUE
`no vote cast, signed by all entitled to vote` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 0
    `votes cast against` IS 0
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS TRUE
`1 for, 0 against` MEANS `Vote tally` WITH
    `votes cast in favour` IS 1
    `votes cast against` IS 0
    `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `ordinary resolution within s 2(1)` `51 for, 49 against`
#ASSERT `ordinary resolution within s 2(1)` `2 for, 1 against`
#ASSERT `ordinary resolution within s 2(1)` `1 for, 0 against`
-- a tie is not a majority
#ASSERT (NOT `ordinary resolution within s 2(1)` `50 for, 50 against`)
#ASSERT (NOT `ordinary resolution within s 2(1)` `1 for, 2 against`)
#ASSERT (NOT `ordinary resolution within s 2(1)` `no vote cast`)
-- special: not less than two-thirds of the votes cast: 200 of 300 is exactly two-thirds, 199 of 300 is not
#ASSERT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `200 for, 100 against`
#ASSERT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `2 for, 1 against`
#ASSERT (NOT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `199 for, 101 against`)
#ASSERT (NOT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `51 for, 49 against`)
#ASSERT (NOT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `50 for, 50 against`)
#ASSERT (NOT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `no vote cast`)
#ASSERT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `1 for, 0 against`
-- "or signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote", whatever the votes
#ASSERT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `10 for, 20 against, signed by all entitled to vote`
#ASSERT `special resolution within s 2(1)` `no vote cast, signed by all entitled to vote`
-- signing does not make it an ordinary resolution
#ASSERT (NOT `ordinary resolution within s 2(1)` `10 for, 20 against, signed by all entitled to vote`)
#ASSERT `resolution passed as the kind within s 2(1)` `an ordinary resolution` `51 for, 49 against`
#ASSERT (NOT `resolution passed as the kind within s 2(1)` `a special resolution` `51 for, 49 against`)
#ASSERT `resolution passed as the kind within s 2(1)` `a special resolution` `200 for, 100 against`

